- Verify round input attestations before they reach the round coordinator
  Checking them costs inputs times outputs, so `SubmitPayment` now does it on
  its own task and the coordinator only compares the attempt challenge. A
  large request no longer stalls the round for everyone else. `SubmitPayment`
  also fails with `InvalidArgument` when no round attempt is collecting
  payments instead of dropping the request silently.
  [#XXXX](https://gitlab.com/ark-bitcoin/bark/-/merge_requests/XXXX)

- Add a delivery receipt for hinted invoices in expiry payout mode
  Operators can match a sale to its registered outputs in the receiver's
  mailbox while the receiver is offline and recover the same receipt after
  the receiver spends the outputs. The receipt includes the amount
  delivered and the earliest output expiry.
  [#XXXX](https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/scuttle/pull/XXXX)
